ight before the first element such that `p` is true, or at the end of\nthe list if `p` always false on `l`.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.insertP","kind":"def","line":1009,"name":"List.insertP","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L1009-L1019"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.isSubperm\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">isSubperm</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BEq\">BEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">l₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">l₂</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`O(|l₁| * (|l₁| + |l₂|))`. Computes whether `l₁` is a sublist of a permutation of `l₂`.\nSee `isSubperm_iff` for a characterization in terms of `List.Subperm`.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.isSubperm","kind":"def","line":1003,"name":"List.isSubperm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L1003-L1007"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.«term_&lt;+~_»\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">«term_&lt;+~_»</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.TrailingParserDescr\">Lean.TrailingParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`Subperm l₁ l₂`, denoted `l₁ <+~ l₂`, means that `l₁` is a sublist of\na permutation of `l₂`. This is an analogue of `l₁ ⊆ l₂` which respects\nmultiplicities of elements, and is used for the `≤` relation on multisets.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.«term_<+~_»","kind":"def","line":1001,"name":"List.«term_<+~_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L1001-L1001"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.Subperm\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">Subperm</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">l₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">l₂</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Prop</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`Subperm l₁ l₂`, denoted `l₁ <+~ l₂`, means that `l₁` is a sublist of\na permutation of `l₂`. This is an analogue of `l₁ ⊆ l₂` which respects\nmultiplicities of elements, and is used for the `≤` relation on multisets.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.Subperm","kind":"def","line":994,"name":"List.Subperm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L994-L999"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.traverse\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">traverse</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">F</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1 → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_2</span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_3}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Applicative\">Applicative</a> <span class=\"fn\">F</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">F</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">F</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span>)</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Map each element of a `List` to an action, evaluate these actions in order,\nand collect the results.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.traverse","kind":"def","line":986,"name":"List.traverse","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L986-L992"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.mapWithComplement\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">mapWithComplement</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_2}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`List.mapWithComplement f l` is a variant of `List.mapWithPrefixSuffix`\nthat maps `f` across a list `l`.\nFor each `a ∈ l` with `l = pref ++ [a] ++ suff`, `a` is mapped to `f a (pref ++ suff)`,\ni.e., the list input to `f` is `l` with `a` removed.\nExample: if `f : Nat → list Nat → β`, `List.mapWithComplement f [1, 2, 3]` will produce the list\n`[f 1 [2, 3], f 2 [1, 3], f 3 [1, 2]]`.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.mapWithComplement","kind":"def","line":975,"name":"List.mapWithComplement","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L975-L984"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.mapWithPrefixSuffix\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">mapWithPrefixSuffix</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_2}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">l</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`List.mapWithPrefixSuffix f l` maps `f` across a list `l`.\nFor each `a ∈ l` with `l = pref ++ [a] ++ suff`, `a` is mapped to `f pref a suff`.\nExample: if `f : list Nat → Nat → list Nat → β`,\n`List.mapWithPrefixSuffix f [1, 2, 3]` will produce the list\n`[f [] 1 [2, 3], f [1] 2 [3], f [1, 2] 3 []]`.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.mapWithPrefixSuffix","kind":"def","line":965,"name":"List.mapWithPrefixSuffix","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batterie