c.html#List.dropSlice","kind":"def","line":672,"name":"List.dropSlice","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L672-L676"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.getRest\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">getRest</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`getRest l l₁` returns `some l₂` if `l = l₁ ++ l₂`.\nIf `l₁` is not a prefix of `l`, returns `none` ","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.getRest","kind":"def","line":665,"name":"List.getRest","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L665-L670"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.forDiagM\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">forDiagM</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1 → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_2</span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_3}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#PUnit\">PUnit</a></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#PUnit\">PUnit</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`forDiagM f l` calls `f` on all elements in the upper triangular part of `l × l`.\nThat is, for each `e ∈ l`, it will run `f e e` and then `f e e'`\nfor each `e'` that appears after `e` in `l`.\n```\nforDiagM f [1, 2, 3] = do f 1 1; f 1 2; f 1 3; f 2 2; f 2 3; f 3 3\n```\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.forDiagM","kind":"def","line":653,"name":"List.forDiagM","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L653-L663"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.mapDiagM\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">mapDiagM</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1 → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_2</span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_3}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">l</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">β</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`mapDiagM f l` calls `f` on all elements in the upper triangular part of `l × l`.\nThat is, for each `e ∈ l`, it will run `f e e` and then `f e e'`\nfor each `e'` that appears after `e` in `l`.\n```\nmapDiagM f [1, 2, 3] =\n  return [← f 1 1, ← f 1 2, ← f 1 3, ← f 2 2, ← f 2 3, ← f 3 3]\n```\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.mapDiagM","kind":"def","line":635,"name":"List.mapDiagM","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L635-L651"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.rotate'\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">rotate'</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`rotate'` is the same as `rotate`, but slower. Used for proofs about `rotate` ","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.rotate'","kind":"def","line":629,"name":"List.rotate'","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L629-L633"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.rotate\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">rotate</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">l</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Na