Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Auxiliary for `lookmap`: `lookmap.go f l acc = acc.toList ++ lookmap f l`. ","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.lookmap.go","kind":"def","line":287,"name":"List.lookmap.go","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Data/List/Basic.lean#L287-L291"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.lookmap\"><span class=\"name\">List</span>.<span class=\"name\">lookmap</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">l</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`lookmap` is a combination of `lookup` and `filterMap`.\n`lookmap f l` will apply `f : α → Option α` to each element of the list,\nreplacing `a → b` at the first value `a` in the list such that `f a = some b`.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Data/List/Basic.html#List.lookmap","kind":"def","line":280,"name":"List.lookmap","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a0672081